{"slug": "api-gateways", "voice": "af_heart", "accent": "us", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 314.875, "contentHash": "edc1d55a06a1ba98333292bb14b90c0031b4aef1572f5c6ff6f1fc0b7b91e33b", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "API Gateways", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.95, "words": [{"text": "API", "start": 0.35, "end": 0.85}, {"text": "Gateways", "start": 0.85, "end": 1.675}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "The front door of your system: routing, authentication, rate limiting, and request shaping — and how gateways differ from plain reverse proxies.", "start": 1.95, "end": 11.35, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 2.2, "end": 2.312}, {"text": "front", "start": 2.312, "end": 2.575}, {"text": "door", "start": 2.575, "end": 2.812}, {"text": "of", "start": 2.812, "end": 2.888}, {"text": "your", "start": 2.888, "end": 3.025}, {"text": "system", "start": 3.025, "end": 3.75}, {"text": "routing", "start": 3.75, "end": 4.425}, {"text": "authentication", "start": 4.425, "end": 5.575}, {"text": "rate", "start": 5.575, "end": 5.975}, {"text": "limiting", "start": 5.975, "end": 6.475}, {"text": "and", "start": 6.475, "end": 6.638}, {"text": "request", "start": 6.638, "end": 7.062}, {"text": "shaping", "start": 7.062, "end": 7.987}, {"text": "and", "start": 7.987, "end": 8.188}, {"text": "how", "start": 8.188, "end": 8.35}, {"text": "gateways", "start": 8.35, "end": 8.875}, {"text": "differ", "start": 8.875, "end": 9.2}, {"text": "from", "start": 9.2, "end": 9.412}, {"text": "plain", "start": 9.412, "end": 9.8}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 9.8, "end": 10.2}, {"text": "proxies", "start": 10.2, "end": 11.1}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 11.35, "end": 13.05, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 11.7, "end": 11.862}, {"text": "this", "start": 11.862, "end": 12.05}, {"text": "matters", "start": 12.05, "end": 12.775}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "The moment you have more than a couple of services, clients face an annoying question: who do I talk to? Dozens of service addresses, each with its own auth scheme, its own rate limits, its own quirks. An API gateway answers by being the single front door: one address, one auth story, one place where cross-cutting concerns live. Every request passes through it; every service behind it stays focused on business logic instead of reinventing TLS termination for the ninth time.", "start": 13.05, "end": 40.825, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 13.325, "end": 13.4}, {"text": "moment", "start": 13.4, "end": 13.688}, {"text": "you", "start": 13.688, "end": 13.775}, {"text": "have", "start": 13.775, "end": 13.975}, {"text": "more", "start": 13.975, "end": 14.138}, {"text": "than", "start": 14.138, "end": 14.238}, {"text": "a", "start": 14.238, "end": 14.3}, {"text": "couple", "start": 14.3, "end": 14.562}, {"text": "of", "start": 14.562, "end": 14.65}, {"text": "services", "start": 14.65, "end": 15.325}, {"text": "clients", "start": 15.325, "end": 15.875}, {"text": "face", "start": 15.875, "end": 16.137}, {"text": "an", "start": 16.137, "end": 16.225}, {"text": "annoying", "start": 16.225, "end": 16.6}, {"text": "question", "start": 16.6, "end": 17.35}, {"text": "who", "start": 17.35, "end": 17.562}, {"text": "do", "start": 17.562, "end": 17.663}, {"text": "I", "start": 17.663, "end": 17.75}, {"text": "talk", "start": 17.75, "end": 18.038}, {"text": "to", "start": 18.038, "end": 18.4}, {"text": "Dozens", "start": 18.4, "end": 19.113}, {"text": "of", "start": 19.113, "end": 19.2}, {"text": "service", "start": 19.2, "end": 19.55}, {"text": "addresses", "start": 19.55, "end": 20.225}, {"text": "each", "start": 20.225, "end": 20.538}, {"text": "with", "start": 20.538, "end": 20.663}, {"text": "its", "start": 20.663, "end": 20.775}, {"text": "own", "start": 20.775, "end": 20.975}, {"text": "auth", "start": 20.975, "end": 21.2}, {"text": "scheme", "start": 21.2, "end": 21.6}, {"text": "its", "start": 21.6, "end": 21.85}, {"text": "own", "start": 21.8