xt": "the", "start": 63.125, "end": 63.225}, {"text": "lobby", "start": 63.225, "end": 63.525}, {"text": "chaos", "start": 63.525, "end": 64.275}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "Gateway vs. reverse proxy vs. load balancer", "start": 64.525, "end": 68.475, "words": [{"text": "Gateway", "start": 64.8, "end": 65.15}, {"text": "vs", "start": 65.15, "end": 65.6}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 65.6, "end": 65.975}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 65.975, "end": 66.375}, {"text": "vs", "start": 66.375, "end": 67.062}, {"text": "load", "start": 67.062, "end": 67.375}, {"text": "balancer", "start": 67.375, "end": 68.225}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "These get conflated constantly, so let's be precise:", "start": 68.475, "end": 72.2, "words": [{"text": "These", "start": 68.75, "end": 68.975}, {"text": "get", "start": 68.975, "end": 69.15}, {"text": "conflated", "start": 69.15, "end": 69.675}, {"text": "constantly", "start": 69.675, "end": 70.45}, {"text": "so", "start": 70.45, "end": 70.75}, {"text": "let's", "start": 70.75, "end": 70.938}, {"text": "be", "start": 70.938, "end": 71.075}, {"text": "precise", "start": 71.075, "end": 71.925}]}, {"index": 7, "kind": "prose", "text": "Load balancer — distributes traffic across instances of the same service. (See Load Balancers.)", "start": 72.2, "end": 78.775, "words": [{"text": "Load", "start": 72.5, "end": 72.725}, {"text": "balancer", "start": 72.725, "end": 73.475}, {"text": "distributes", "start": 73.475, "end": 74.15}, {"text": "traffic", "start": 74.15, "end": 74.65}, {"text": "across", "start": 74.65, "end": 75.0}, {"text": "instances", "start": 75.0, "end": 75.612}, {"text": "of", "start": 75.612, "end": 75.688}, {"text": "the", "start": 75.688, "end": 75.775}, {"text": "same", "start": 75.775, "end": 76.05}, {"text": "service", "start": 76.05, "end": 76.875}, {"text": "See", "start": 76.875, "end": 77.325}, {"text": "Load", "start": 77.325, "end": 77.575}, {"text": "Balancers", "start": 77.575, "end": 78.525}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Reverse proxy — forwards requests to backends, terminates TLS, maybe caches. One step up: it can route by path, but it's fundamentally a traffic cop.", "start": 78.775, "end": 89.15, "words": [{"text": "Reverse", "start": 79.05, "end": 79.475}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 79.475, "end": 80.163}, {"text": "forwards", "start": 80.163, "end": 80.688}, {"text": "requests", "start": 80.688, "end": 81.075}, {"text": "to", "start": 81.075, "end": 81.175}, {"text": "backends", "start": 81.175, "end": 82.0}, {"text": "terminates", "start": 82.0, "end": 82.713}, {"text": "TLS", "start": 82.713, "end": 83.375}, {"text": "maybe", "start": 83.375, "end": 83.7}, {"text": "caches", "start": 83.7, "end": 84.675}, {"text": "One", "start": 84.675, "end": 85.075}, {"text": "step", "start": 85.075, "end": 85.312}, {"text": "up", "start": 85.312, "end": 85.75}, {"text": "it", "start": 85.75, "end": 85.938}, {"text": "can", "start": 85.938, "end": 86.075}, {"text": "route", "start": 86.075, "end": 86.275}, {"text": "by", "start": 86.275, "end": 86.463}, {"text": "path", "start": 86.463, "end": 86.875}, {"text": "but", "start": 86.875, "end": 87.062}, {"text": "it's", "start": 87.062, "end": 87.238}, {"text": "fundamentally", "start": 87.238, "end": 87.9}, {"text": "a", "start": 87.9, "end": 87.975}, {"text": "traffic", "start": 87.975, "end": 88.35}, {"text": "cop", "start": 88.35, "end": 88.875}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "API gateway — a reverse proxy with opinions: authentication, rate limiting, request transformation, API composition, and observability, usually configured per-route or per-API. Kong, AWS API Gateway, Apigee, and Envoy-based setups live here.", "start": 89.15, "end": 107.9, "words": [{"text": "API", "start": 89.45, "end": 89.975}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 89.975, "end": 90.562}, {"text": "a", "start": 90.562, "end": 90.75}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 90.75, "end": 91.15}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 91.1