le", "start": 152.188, "end": 152.188}, {"text": "tiered", "start": 152.188, "end": 152.5}, {"text": "quotas", "start": 152.5, "end": 153.25}, {"text": "10", "start": 153.25, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "000", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "requests", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "day", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "on", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "the", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "free", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "tier", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "are", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "a", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "config", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "not", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "application", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "code", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "See", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "Rate", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "Limiting", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "for", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "the", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}, {"text": "algorithms", "start": 161.475, "end": 161.475}]}, {"index": 14, "kind": "prose", "text": "Request shaping. The gateway translates between the outside world's needs and your services' reality: REST in, gRPC out; aggregating three service calls into one client response (reducing chatty mobile round trips); stripping internal fields you never meant to expose. (That last one has caused real CVEs. The gateway is your last line of defense against accidentally serializing is_admin.)", "start": 161.575, "end": 187.15, "words": [{"text": "Request", "start": 161.825, "end": 162.262}, {"text": "shaping", "start": 162.262, "end": 163.15}, {"text": "The", "start": 163.15, "end": 163.375}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 163.375, "end": 163.775}, {"text": "translates", "start": 163.775, "end": 164.375}, {"tex