": "caused", "start": 180.075, "end": 180.487}, {"text": "real", "start": 180.487, "end": 180.787}, {"text": "CVEs", "start": 180.787, "end": 181.875}, {"text": "The", "start": 181.875, "end": 182.1}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 182.1, "end": 182.6}, {"text": "is", "start": 182.6, "end": 182.712}, {"text": "your", "start": 182.712, "end": 182.887}, {"text": "last", "start": 182.887, "end": 183.275}, {"text": "line", "start": 183.275, "end": 183.512}, {"text": "of", "start": 183.512, "end": 183.6}, {"text": "defense", "start": 183.6, "end": 184.1}, {"text": "against", "start": 184.1, "end": 184.487}, {"text": "accidentally", "start": 184.487, "end": 185.275}, {"text": "serializing", "start": 185.275, "end": 186.05}, {"text": "is", "start": 186.05, "end": 187.05}, {"text": "admin", "start": 187.05, "end": 187.05}]}, {"index": 15, "kind": "prose", "text": "Observability. One choke point means one place to log every request, measure latency percentiles, and trace calls across services. When the 3 AM page arrives, the gateway's dashboards are where you start.", "start": 187.15, "end": 201.225, "words": [{"text": "Observability", "start": 187.425, "end": 188.65}, {"text": "One", "start": 188.65, "end": 189.113}, {"text": "choke", "start": 189.113, "end": 189.438}, {"text": "point", "start": 189.438, "end": 189.825}, {"text": "means", "start": 189.825, "end": 190.138}, {"text": "one", "start": 190.138, "end": 190.375}, {"text": "place", "start": 190.375, "end": 190.7}, {"text": "to", "start": 190.7, "end": 190.825}, {"text": "log", "start": 190.825, "end": 191.188}, {"text": "every", "start": 191.188, "end": 191.525}, {"text": "request", "start": 191.525, "end": 192.3}, {"text": "measure", "start": 192.3, "end": 192.775}, {"text": "latency", "start": 192.775, "end": 193.175}, {"text": "percentiles", "start": 193.175, "end": 194.0}, {"text": "and", "start": 194.0, "end": 194.213}, {"text": "trace", "start": 194.213, "end": 194.55}, {"text": "calls", "start": 194.55, "end": 194.925}, {"text": "across", "start": 194.925, "end": 195.25}, {"text": "services", "start": 195.25, "end": 196.325}, {"text": "When", "start": 196.325, "end": 196.588}, {"text": "the", "start": 196.588, "end": 196.725}, {"text": "3", "start": 196.725, "end": 197.062}, {"text": "AM", "start": 197.062, "end": 197.55}, {"text": "page", "start": 197.55, "end": 197.875}, {"text": "arrives", "start": 197.875, "end": 198.575}, {"text": "the", "start": 198.575, "end": 198.775}, {"text": "gateway's", "start": 198.775, "end": 199.25}, {"text": "dashboards", "start": 199.25, "end": 199.95}, {"text": "are", "start": 199.95, "end": 200.037}, {"text": "where", "start": 200.037, "end": 200.175}, {"text": "you", "start": 200.175, "end": 200.3}, {"text": "start", "start": 200.3, "end": 200.975}]}, {"index": 16, "kind": "prose", "text": "The BFF pattern", "start": 201.225, "end": 203.1, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 201.525, "end": 201.65}, {"text": "BFF", "start": 201.65, "end": 202.15}, {"text": "pattern", "start": 202.15, "end": 202.825}]}, {"index": 17, "kind": "prose", "text": "One gateway rarely fits all clients. A mobile app wants tiny, aggregated payloads; a web app wants something richer; partner integrations want stability above all. The Backend for Frontend (BFF) pattern gives each client type its own gateway layer, each optimized for that client's needs — all fronting the same services. It's more gateways to run, but each one is simpler and changes for the right reasons.", "start": 203.1, "end": 228.35, "words": [{"text": "One", "start": 203.4, "end": 203.625}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 203.625, "end": 204.037}, {"text": "rarely", "start": 204.037, "end": 204.438}, {"text": "fits", "start": 204.438, "end": 204.725}, {"text": "all", "start": 204.725, "end": 204.925}, {"text": "clients", "start": 204.925, "end": 205.8}, {"text": "A", "start": 205.8, "end": 206.037}, {"text": "mobile", "start": 206.037, "end": 206.375}, {"text": "app", "start": 206.375, "end": 206.6}, {"text": "wants", "start": 206.6, "end": 206.887}, {"text": "tiny", "start": 206.887, "end": 207.325}, {"text": "aggregated", "start": 207.325, "end": 208.025}, {"text": "payloads", "start": 208.025, "end": 208.9}, {"text": "a", "start": 208.9, "end": 209.137}, {"text": "web", "start": 209.137, "end": 209.375}, {"text": "app", "start": 209.375, "end": 209.6}, {"text": "wants", "start": 209.6, "end": 209.812}, {"text": "something", "start": 209.812, "end": 210.1}, {"text": "richer", "start": 210.1, "end": 210.65}, {"text": "partner", "start": 210.65, "end": 211.062}, {"text": "integrations", "start": 211.062, "end": 211.75}, {"text": "want", "start": 211.75, "end": 211.95}, {"text": "stability", "start": 211.95, "end": 212.55}, {"text": "above", "start": 212.55, "end": 212.825}, {"text": "all", "start": 212.825, "end": 213.55}, {"text": "The", "start": 213.55, "end": 213.825}, {"text": "Backend", "start": 213.825, "end": 214.275}, {"text": "for", "start": 214.275, "end": 214.438}, {"text": "Frontend", "start": 214.438, "end": 215.05}, {"text": "BFF", "start": 215.05, "end": 215.875}, {"text": "pattern", "start": 215.875, "end": 216.45}, {"text": "gives", "start": 216.45, "end": 216.725}, {"text": "each", "start": 216.725, "end": 216.95}, {"text": "client", "start": 216.95, "end": 217.275}, {"text": "type", "start": 217.275, "end": 217.512}, {"text": "its", "start": 217.512, "end": 217.713}, {"text": "own", "start": 217.713, "end": 217.975}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 217.975, "end": 218.325}, {"text": "layer", "start": 218.325, "end": 218.85}, {"text": "each", "start": 218.85, "end": 219.175}, {"text": "optimized", "start": 219.175, "end": 219.775}, {"text": "for", "start": 219.775, "end": 219.9}, {"text": "that", "start": 219.9, "end": 220.1}, {"text": "client's", "start": 220.1, "end": 220.5}, {"text": "needs", "start": 220.5, "end": 221.088}, {"text": "all", "start": 221.088, "end": 221.463}, {"text": "fronting", "start": 221.463, "end": 221.838}, {"text": "the", "start": 221.838, "end": 221.938}, {"text": "same", "start": 221.938, "end": 222.25}, {"text": "services", "start": 222.25, "end": 223.3}, {"text": "It's", "start": 223.3, "end": 223.65}, {"text": "more", "start": 223.65, "end": 223.875}, {"text": "gateways", "start": 223.875, "end": 224.3}, {"text": "to", "start": 224.3, "end": 224.425}, {"text": "run", "start": 224.425, "end": 224.925}, {"text": "but", "start": 224.925, "end": 225.162}, {"text": "each", "start": 225.162, "end": 225.4}, {"text": "one", "start": 225.4, "end": 225.575}, {"text": "is", "start": 225.575, "end": 225.713}, {"text": "simpler", "start": 225.713, "end": 226.213}, {"text": "and", "start": 226.213, "end": 226.362}, {"text": "changes", "start": 226.362, "end": 226.875}, {"text": "for", "start": 226.875, "end": 226.987}, {"text": "the", "start": 226.987, "end": 227.075}, {"text": "right", "start": 227.075, "end": 227.3}, {"text": "reasons", "start": 227.3, "end": 228.1}]}, {"index": 18, "kind": "prose", "text": "The honest trade-offs", "start": 228.35, "end": 230.15, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 228.65, "end": 228.787}, {"text": "honest", "start": 228.787, "end": 229.125}, {"text": "trade", "start": 229.125, "end": 229.9}, {"text": "offs", "start": 229.9, "end": 229.9}]}, {"index": 19, "kind": "prose", "text": "A gateway is a single point of control and therefore a single point of failure. If it goes down, everything behind it is unreachable — so it must be deployed redundantly across zones, with health checks and fast failover. It also adds latency (one more hop, usually single-digit milliseconds) and can become a bottleneck of ownership: when every team needs a route change and one platform team owns the gateway config, you've built a very expensive ticket queue. Good gateway platforms solve this with self-service config and GitOps workflows.", "start": 230.15, "end": 263.4, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 230.425, "end": 230.5}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 230.5, "end": 231.0},